      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Employers.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Projects.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Needs both skills.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Move toward lead.</p>
    </div>
