      <div class="route-card__top">
        <span class="route-card__n">06</span>
        <span class="chip chip--mid">Scalable with a business layer</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Pharma and clinical research roles</h3>
      <p class="route-card__why">Support trials.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Firms.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Clean data.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Cyclical.</p>
