  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      <strong>The ownership path:</strong> offer data cleaning and basic analysis help to student researchers, with clear scope, privacy care and credit to the original data owners.
    </p>
    <p>
      Respect data rules.
    </p>
