          <td data-label="Bioinformatics trial">Make two simple charts</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Day"><strong>11 to 14</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Biotechnology trial">Ask a lab person to review</td>
          <td data-label="Bioinformatics trial">Ask a data person to review</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Notice which feels more absorbing, not which sounds more impressive.
  </p>

